  "name": "IHC - SOFT TISSUE TUMOUR",
  "code": "1952",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"1581\">\n<thead data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"416\">\n<tr data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"416\">\n<th data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"316\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"312\">IHC Marker</strong></th>\n<th data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"338\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"337\">Possible Result</strong></th>\n<th data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"416\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"378\">Interpretation / Tumor Association</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"1581\">\n<tr data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"662\">\n<td data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"559\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"553\">Vimentin</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"582\">Positive</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"662\">Indicates mesenchymal (soft tissue) origin &mdash; seen in most soft tissue tumors</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"786\">\n<td data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"683\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"675\">Desmin</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"706\">Positive</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"786\">Suggests muscle origin &mdash; seen in <strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"761\">rhabdomyosarcoma</strong>, <strong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"781\">leiomyosarcoma</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"913\">\n<td data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"807\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"801\">Myogenin</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"830\">Positive</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"913\">Highly specific for <strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"878\">skeletal muscle tumors</strong>, especially <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"911\">rhabdomyosarcoma</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1037\">\n<td data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"934\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"923\">SMA</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"957\">Positive</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1037\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1002\">smooth muscle differentiation</strong> &mdash; seen in <strong data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1031\">leiomyosarcoma</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1174\">\n<td data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1058\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1049\">S-100</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1081\">Positive</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1174\">Seen in <strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1114\">nerve sheath tumors</strong> (e.g., <strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1136\">schwannoma</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1154\">neurofibroma</strong>) and <strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1172\">melanoma</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1326\">\n<td data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1195\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1185\">CD34</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1218\">Positive</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1326\">Positive in <strong data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1251\">vascular tumors</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1295\">dermatofibrosarcoma protuberans (DFSP)</strong>, and some soft tissue tumors</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1450\">\n<td data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1347\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1337\">CD99</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1370\">Positive</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1450\">Seen in <strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1399\">Ewing's sarcoma</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1409\">PNET</strong>, and some <strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1441\">synovial sarcomas</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1581\">\n<td data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1471\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1470\">Ki-67 (Index)</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1494\">e.g., 5% / 30%</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1581\">Indicates tumor proliferation: &lt;10% = low grade; &gt;20% = high-grade/aggressive tumor</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
